  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">床<span style=\"color:#999\">戰</span></span>地圖</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">洞穴</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">由 <span style=\"color:#800000\">KronixLP &amp; Kazeio<br></span></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">免費使用！若你使用此地圖，請務必將伺服器 IP 傳給我！<span style=\"color:#800080\"><strong>Discord：</strong>KronixLP#9308 <br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000\">你可以將此地圖用於你的小遊戲伺服器！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\">模式：床戰 </span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span>建議</span>配置：可支援 1x 至 4x4 團隊</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\">座標：0 64 0</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\">遊戲版本：1.7 及以上皆適用</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000\">4 個出生島</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000\">4 個鐵礦島</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000\">1 個金礦島（中央）</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">本地圖專為原版床戰的<span style=\"color:#fc0\">黃金</span>、<span style=\"color:#999\">鐵</span>、<span style=\"color:#930\">青銅</span>模式設計。亦可改為<span style=\"color:#3cc\">鑽石</span>、<span style=\"color:#808080\">鐵</span>與<span style=\"color:#fc0\">黃金</span>模式。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S-mEb3_vSiM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/project/2021/620/13824520_l.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"450\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
